This chapter is the lookup reference for the user-visible surface of
@code{beads.el}.  The task chapters explain how and when to use a
command; this chapter collects the commands, their transient suffixes,
their keybindings, and the user options in one place.  The
@ref{Key Index} lists keystrokes and the @ref{Command and Variable
Index} collects the commands and options alphabetically.

The inventory below is derived mechanically from the menu code and
from the @file{lisp/} sources; the derivation rule is recorded in the
@code{BEGIN GENERATED} comment at the head of @file{doc/reference.texi}
and is enforced by the reference-completeness test.  Commands that are
not reachable from the documented dispatch menus are internal and are
deliberately omitted.

@menu
* Command Reference::          Commands and their transient suffixes.
* Keybinding Reference::       Every key bound in the menus.
* User Option Reference::      Every user option (@code{defcustom}).
@end menu

@node Command Reference
@section Command Reference
@cindex command reference
