@subsection Issues

@deffn {Command} beads-list-all
List beads  (@kbd{l})
List all issues using current transient filter values.
Converts transient args to a ‘beads-issue-spec’ and refreshes the
list buffer.  This is the primary entry point for listing issues:
the dispatch binds ‘l’ directly to it, and it is the ‘l’ suffix of
the ‘beads-list-filters’ transient.
@end deffn

@deffn {Command} beads-compose-create
Create bead  (@kbd{c})
Open a compose buffer to create a new issue.
Returns the buffer.  If a create buffer already exists for this
project, switch to it instead of creating a new one.
@end deffn

