@node Keybinding Reference
@section Keybinding Reference
@cindex keybindings
@kindex keys

Every key bound by the documented dispatch menus, grouped by the
top-level menu group that holds it.  A key path such as @kbd{d} @kbd{a}
means @kbd{d} from the dispatch menu, then @kbd{a} in the dependency
menu.

