- ‘beads-insert-blocked-issues’ — collapsible group of blocked issues
- ‘beads-insert-ready-work’     — collapsible group of ready work
Default: @code{(beads-insert-open-issues beads-insert-blocked-issues beads-insert-re...}.
@end defopt

@defopt beads-swarm-async-timeout
Seconds before an asynchronous swarm fetch is abandoned.
